            "text": "Are you fully girded up, Traveler?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224905",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722490301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722490301": {
            "id": "722490301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "My name is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490302"
            ]
          },
          "722490302": {
            "id": "722490302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Aberaku, Helios-Forger!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490303"
            ]
          },
          "722490303": {
            "id": "722490303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um, what's the Helios?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490304"
            ]
          },
          "722490304": {
            "id": "722490304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is it something very impressive?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490305"
            ]
          },
          "722490305": {
            "id": "722490305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Verily! T'was I who organized the building of the Helios with the might of an entire nation behind me, that we might resist the Dragonheirs of the Depths.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490306"
            ]
          },
          "722490306": {
            "id": "722490306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "This unsurpassed deed could have been done by no other in Byakuyakoku — none save I!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490307"
            ]
          },
          "722490307": {
            "id": "722490307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh. Guess that is pretty impressive.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490308"
            ]
          },
          "722490308": {
            "id": "722490308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But why would such a great person be sealed in here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490309"
            ]
          },
          "722490309": {
            "id": "722490309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "I... I was betrayed...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490310"
            ]
          },
          "722490310": {
            "id": "722490310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "When the sky kingdom crashed into the bottomless depths, the people were scourged by dragons, and thus did I — yes, 'twas I — begin building the Helios to save us all from our fate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490311"
            ]
          },
          "722490311": {
            "id": "722490311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "But... those ravening rogues! The moment their lives were no longer in danger, they began to deceive and lie. They even advocated placing mere infants on the throne. Laughable!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490312"
            ]
          },
          "722490312": {
            "id": "722490312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Even I became the target of their schemes, and was left in jail to rot!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490313"
            ]
          },
          "722490313": {
            "id": "722490313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "A pox! A pox upon them all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490314"
            ]
          },
          "722490314": {
            "id": "722490314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "...Right. You.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490316",
              "722490318"
            ]
          },
          "722490316": {
            "id": "722490316",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yup, that's you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490320"
            ]
          },
          "722490320": {
            "id": "722490320",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "It can only be you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490321"
            ]
          },
          "722490321": {
            "id": "722490321",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "My sacred robes were once placed here, but they have all but rotted away in the passing of years, and can no longer be relied upon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490322"
            ]
          },
          "722490322": {
            "id": "722490322",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "But if you can pass the test, then I shall hand the offerings, into which I have nested my thoughts, unto you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490323"
            ]
          },
          "722490323": {
            "id": "722490323",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "I pray for your... success...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490324"
            ]
          },
          "722490324": {
            "id": "722490324",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "This matter is perilous. Tell me once you are ready, O Traveler, and we shall begin."
          },
          "722490318": {
            "id": "722490318",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Nah, he's clearly looking at you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490319"
            ]
          },
          "722490319": {
            "id": "722490319",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "(With a very heated look in his eyes, too.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224902",
      "subQuestName": "Activate the spirit's trial",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722490501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722490501": {
            "id": "722490501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm ready.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490502"
            ]
          },
          "722490502": {
            "id": "722490502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Then I wish you... every success in your battle ahead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224904",
      "subQuestName": "Obtain the offerings from the spirit",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722490201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722490201": {
            "id": "722490201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "I—Incredible! You may just be able to do this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490202"
            ]
          },
          "722490202": {
            "id": "722490202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Please then, I beg you, carry these offerings... the offerings... you must...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490203"
            ]
          },
          "722490203": {
            "id": "722490203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "You must take them away to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490204"
            ]
          },
          "722490204": {
            "id": "722490204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "To...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490205"
            ]
          },
          "722490205": {
            "id": "722490205",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What's wrong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490206"
            ]
          },
          "722490206": {
            "id": "722490206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh brother, his words are getting less and less clear!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490207"
            ]
          },
          "722490207": {
            "id": "722490207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Take them to the place of enshrining... enjoin the parts of my soul, in order to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490208"
            ]
          },
          "722490208": {
            "id": "722490208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hello, Mr. Spirit?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490209"
            ]
          },
          "722490209": {
            "id": "722490209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "In order to... In order to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490210"
            ]
          },
          "722490210": {
            "id": "722490210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "In order to do what again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490211"
            ]
          },
          "722490211": {
            "id": "722490211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "In order to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490212"
            ]
          },
          "722490212": {
            "id": "722490212",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh, this guy isn't making himself clear at all! But it seems we're supposed to take these offerings somewhere — Paimon got that much.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490213"
            ]
          },
          "722490213": {
            "id": "722490213",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "These offerings have been here for so long. Who knows if there's anything edible here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490214"
            ]
          },
          "722490214": {
            "id": "722490214",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Best not to eat them all the same.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490215"
            ]
          },
          "722490215": {
            "id": "722490215",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "H—Hey! Paimon doesn't just eat anything, alright?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490216"
            ]
          },
          "722490216": {
            "id": "722490216",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Well, let's take the offerings with us anyway, {NICKNAME}."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224906",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722490601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722490601": {
            "id": "722490601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I need a while more to prepare.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722490602"
            ]
          },
          "722490602": {
            "id": "722490602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Then I shall await your tidings."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}